---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="3D Signs in Manchester | Custom 3D Lettering" description="Explore custom 3D signs from Manchester Sign Group. 3D lettering for shopfronts, business premises and branded spaces, with delivery throughout the United Kingdom.">
  <main class="inner-page">
    <div class="page-head"><small>CUSTOM BUSINESS SIGNAGE</small><h1>3D <em>SIGNS</em></h1><p>Make your business name stand out with custom three-dimensional lettering and signage from Manchester Sign Group.</p></div>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Custom 3D lettering for businesses</h2><p>3D signs use raised letters or shapes to give a business sign depth and a clear visual presence. They can be considered for shopfronts, reception areas, offices, retail spaces and other branded environments.</p><p>The right specification depends on where the sign will be displayed, the dimensions available, the lettering or logo, the chosen materials and whether illumination is required. Share your design or describe your idea and we can discuss suitable options.</p></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Choose a sign specification</h2><ul><li><strong>Design:</strong> provide your logo, artwork or business name.</li><li><strong>Size:</strong> include approximate width and height.</li><li><strong>Lighting:</strong> tell us whether you want a non-illuminated or illuminated design.</li><li><strong>Location:</strong> explain where the sign will be fitted so the requirements can be discussed.</li></ul></section>
    <section class="content-card"><h2>Manchester-based, delivery throughout the United Kingdom</h2><p>Manchester Sign Group is based in Manchester and supplies signage to customers throughout the United Kingdom. Delivery availability and project requirements can be confirmed when you request a quote. Installation arrangements should be discussed for your specific project.</p><p>All products include a one-year warranty.</p></section>
    <div class="page-actions"><a href="/quote/">GET A QUOTE →</a><a class="secondary" href="/services/">VIEW ALL SERVICES →</a></div>
    <nav class="related"><strong>Explore other options</strong><a href="/rgb-signs/">RGB 3D signs</a><a href="/neon-signs/">Neon signs</a><a href="/flat-signs/">Flat signs</a></nav>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
.inner-page{width:min(900px,92%);margin:auto;padding:65px 0 85px}.page-head{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:28px}.page-head small{color:#ff1730;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}.page-head h1{font-size:clamp(42px,8vw,72px);letter-spacing:-3px;line-height:1;margin:10px 0 14px}.page-head h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#ff1730}.page-head p,.content-card p,.content-card li{color:#aaa;line-height:1.75;font-size:15px}.content-card{padding:22px 24px;margin:14px 0;background:#0c0f11;border:1px solid #303437;border-radius:12px}.content-card h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}.content-card p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}.content-card ul{padding-left:20px}.content-card li{padding:4px 0}.content-card strong{color:#fff}.page-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:22px}.page-actions a{padding:15px 18px;border-radius:8px;background:#ff1730;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.5px}.page-actions .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #444}.related{display:flex;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-top:28px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid #303437}.related strong{width:100%;font-size:13px}.related a{color:#ff6677;font-size:13px}@media(max-width:600px){.inner-page{padding:45px 0 65px}.content-card{padding:18px}.content-card h2{font-size:19px}.page-head h1{font-size:46px}}
</style>